"i-lucide-bot",{"title":177,"path":178,"stem":179,"icon":180},"Observability","\u002Fplatform\u002Fobservability","02.platform\u002F08.observability","i-lucide-activity",{"title":182,"path":183,"stem":184,"icon":185},"Contributing","\u002Fplatform\u002Fcontributing","02.platform\u002F09.contributing","i-lucide-git-pull-request",{"title":187,"path":188,"stem":189,"icon":190},"System Migrations","\u002Fplatform\u002Fsystem-migrations","02.platform\u002F10.system-migrations","i-lucide-database-zap",{"title":124,"icon":125,"path":192,"stem":193,"children":194,"page":36},"\u002Fplatform\u002Freference","02.platform\u002F11.reference",[195],{"title":196,"path":197,"stem":198,"icon":199},"CRI Format","\u002Fplatform\u002Freference\u002Fcri-format","02.platform\u002F11.reference\u002F01.cri-format","i-lucide-link",{"id":201,"title":144,"body":202,"description":358,"extension":359,"links":360,"meta":361,"navigation":362,"path":145,"seo":363,"stem":146,"__hash__":364},"docs\u002F02.platform\u002F01.architecture.md",{"type":203,"value":204,"toc":351},"minimark",[205,209,213,217,246,250,326,330,333,344],[206,207,25],"h2",{"id":208},"overview",[210,211,212],"p",{},"Kinotic OS is a full-stack application platform that handles service communication, persistence, authentication, authorization, deployment, and observability. The system is composed of several core components that work together to provide a seamless development and runtime experience.",[206,214,216],{"id":215},"core-components","Core Components",[218,219,220,228,234,240],"ul",{},[221,222,223,227],"li",{},[224,225,226],"strong",{},"Kinotic Server"," — The central platform server built on Spring Boot. Manages service registration, authentication, session management, and coordinates all platform operations.",[221,229,230,233],{},[224,231,232],{},"RPC Gateway"," — Routes remote procedure calls between clients and published services over STOMP\u002FWebSocket.",[221,235,236,239],{},[224,237,238],{},"Persistence Layer"," — Provides automatic CRUD operations for entities backed by Elasticsearch.",[221,241,242,245],{},[224,243,244],{},"Auth System"," — Handles authentication (email\u002Fpassword and OIDC). Supports three authorization hierarchies: System, Organization, and Application.",[206,247,249],{"id":248},"tech-stack","Tech Stack",[251,252,253,266],"table",{},[254,255,256],"thead",{},[257,258,259,263],"tr",{},[260,261,262],"th",{},"Component",[260,264,265],{},"Technology",[267,268,269,278,286,294,302,310,318],"tbody",{},[257,270,271,275],{},[272,273,274],"td",{},"Orchestration",[272,276,277],{},"Kubernetes",[257,279,280,283],{},[272,281,282],{},"Build Isolation",[272,284,285],{},"Firecracker VMs",[257,287,288,291],{},[272,289,290],{},"Runtime",[272,292,293],{},"Bun",[257,295,296,299],{},[272,297,298],{},"Database",[272,300,301],{},"Postgres (Hibernate Reactive)",[257,303,304,307],{},[272,305,306],{},"Search\u002FPersistence",[272,308,309],{},"Elasticsearch",[257,311,312,315],{},[272,313,314],{},"Logging",[272,316,317],{},"Grafana Loki",[257,319,320,323],{},[272,321,322],{},"Payments",[272,324,325],{},"Stripe Connect",[206,327,329],{"id":328},"communication","Communication",[210,331,332],{},"Services communicate via STOMP over WebSocket, with messages routed by CRI (Kinotic Resource Identifier). Each service, method, and event stream is addressable through a CRI, which follows the format:",[334,335,340],"pre",{"className":336,"code":338,"language":339},[337],"language-text","scheme:\u002F\u002F[scope@]resourceName[\u002Fpath][#version]\n","text",[341,342,338],"code",{"__ignoreMap":343},"",[210,345,346,347,350],{},"The RPC gateway uses CRIs to route requests to the correct service instance, apply versioning, and enforce scope-based multi-tenancy. See the ",[348,349,196],"a",{"href":197}," reference for details.",{"title":343,"searchDepth":352,"depth":352,"links":353},2,[354,355,356,357],{"id":208,"depth":352,"text":25},{"id":215,"depth":352,"text":216},{"id":248,"depth":352,"text":249},{"id":328,"depth":352,"text":329},"High-level architecture of the Kinotic OS platform.","md",null,{},{"icon":147},{"title":144,"description":358},"LzLf9Y55v9vKaJi_QN_TsSqv-Ty16YCEuMbrVI-VT0M",[366,368],{"title":135,"path":136,"stem":137,"description":367,"icon":60,"children":-1},"Complete SQL grammar reference for migration scripts.",{"title":149,"path":150,"stem":151,"description":369,"icon":6,"children":-1},"Deploying and operating Kinotic OS in various environments.",1787809045088]